# Intermediate build output. The per-game `dist/` folder is a Vite artifact and
# is never deployed — tools/build-games.mjs copies the built file out to
# games/<id>/play.html, which IS committed (see below).
games/*/dist/

# NOTE: games/*/play.html is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# Vercel excludes gitignored files from the deployment, so ignoring the built
# play.html meant the three Vite games were missing from production and every
# link to them 404'd. play.html is committed so it always deploys, and
# `npm run build` still regenerates it on every deploy so the deployed copy is
# always freshly built from src/ — the committed version is only a fallback
# for local static hosting.